{"title":"Power","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Power</b> is loosely defined as the speed something can do <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Work\" title=\"Work\">work</a>. The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=SI\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SI\">SI</a> unit for power is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Watt\" title=\"Watt\">Watt</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Formal_Definition\">Formal Definition</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Power&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Formal Definition\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Power is the amount of work that is done over a given period of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Time\" title=\"Time\">time</a>. It is also the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Derivative\" title=\"Derivative\">derivative</a> of work. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is power, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/c/10cb764f88509fb1c8012366993fdbee98f31bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$W$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" /> is work, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> is time, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/a/7bafaa4a0698b5b7a3ed1378be7c278f45e972e7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P=\\frac{W}{t}\\]\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Power&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Work\" title=\"Work\">Work</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Watt\" title=\"Watt\">Watt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics\" title=\"Physics\">Physics</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Power&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017163709\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 37/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 256/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 675/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.672      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.672      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:5954:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017163709 and revision id 23802. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}